flowchart TD
    Start([Client requests POST /analyze]) --> GetContext[Retrieve Top-K vectors]
    GetContext --> Prompt[Build LLM Prompt]
    Prompt --> Infer[Ollama Inference]
    Infer --> Validate{Pydantic Valid?}
    Validate -->|No| Refine{Max Stages Hit?}
    Refine -->|No| Prompt
    Refine -->|Yes| Fallback[Return partial/error result]
    Validate -->|Yes| GoalCheck{Goal Validated?}
    GoalCheck -->|No| Refine
    GoalCheck -->|Yes| Save[Save AnalysisResult]
    Save --> End([Return Analysis])
